summary:
  The MPRIS state carries the picture on the Playing page, not the song's
  own cover.

history:
  The lock screen and the media controls show mpris:artUrl with nothing
  beside it to say what it is. With "Alen Veziko - Päiksepoolsel tänaval"
  on air it was the sleeve of "Nüüd taas sajab lund" (busctl, 2026-11-12).
  The state is written from trackArtUrl now. This mutant writes it from the
  picture the Playing page shows.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
              art: root.trackArtUrl || root.imageurl

replace:
              art: root.albumArtUrl || root.imageurl

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_only_the_songs_own_cover_leaves_the_playing_page.
  Line-neutral.
